# =============================================================================
# MoOS live/preinstall Flatpak set — one Flathub ref per line.
# Consumed by the Titanoboa action (see .github/workflows/build-iso.yml).
# Flatpak/Flathub is the ONLY promoted app source in MoOS. The one visible app
# store is **Mo Store** (/usr/bin/moos-store, org.moos.store). Bazaar is NOT
# preinstalled — it is Mo Store's OPTIONAL full-Flathub catalog + app-lifecycle
# engine, added on demand (moos-setup / "Browse all"), so a fresh device shows
# exactly ONE store, never two. Keep this list small: it inflates the ISO size.
# =============================================================================
org.mozilla.firefox
org.videolan.VLC
org.libreoffice.LibreOffice
org.kde.kcalc
